OL,5,G1300 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDocumentary series about an NHS
OL,7,     Fsurgery. Back pain could be
OL,8,     Fprostate cancer, a urinary
OL,9,     Finfection could be a kidney stone,
OL,10,     Fand vitiligo could be something
OL,11,     Faltogether different.
OL,12,G1400 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDocumentary series filmed inside
OL,14,     Fthe Ridge Medical Practice in
OL,15,     FBradford. Banana, camel and
OL,16,     Fwrestling costumes are at the
OL,17,     Fready for some imaginative
OL,18,     Fhealthcare tutorials.
