OL,5,G1500 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FPhillip is dizzy and
OL,7,     Fdisorientated, and his GP suspects
OL,8,     Fan amnesiac disorder. Already on
OL,9,     Fanti-anxiety meds, Karen may have
OL,10,     FPTSD, so is referred for
OL,11,     Fpsychiatric assessment.
OL,12,G1600 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FThe team do not so much as blush
OL,14,     Fin the face of embarrassing
OL,15,     Fillnesses. Eighty-year-old Aristo
OL,16,     Fis having trouble in the bedroom.
OL,17,     FSilvia is struggling with
OL,18,     Fexcessive flatulence.
